      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Endorsement API",
      "Anchor": "endorsement-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Usage of this API is restricted to approved partners, subject to limitations via API agreement.\nAll API requests are represented in protocol 2.0.0. Therefore, all API requests require the header X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Endorsement API",
      "Anchor": "endorsement-api",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "With the Endorsement API, you can replicate the full LinkedIn experience around endorsing skills of LinkedIn members.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Create Endorsements",
      "Anchor": "create-endorsements",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Create Endorsements"
      ],
      "Text": "Send an endorsement by issuing a POST that specifies the recipient and his/her skill. You can only send endorsements on behalf of the authenticated user.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Create Endorsements",
      "Anchor": "create-endorsements",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Create Endorsements"
      ],
      "Text": "POST https://api.linkedin.com/v2/endorsement",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "table",
      "Section": "Request Body Fields",
      "Anchor": "request-body-fields",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Create Endorsements",
        "Request Body Fields"
      ],
      "Text": "",
      "Headers": [
        "Field",
        "Sub-Field",
        "Description",
        "Format",
        "Required"
      ],
      "Rows": [
        [
          {
            "Text": "recipient",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The recipient entity id",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Person Urn",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "item",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Entity for a recipient that can be endorsed.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "nonStandardEntity. entityPhrase",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The value of the entity skill being endorsed. For example: JAVA",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "String",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "nonStandardEntity. entityType",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The type of entity. Always the enum PROFILE_SKILL",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "String",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "status",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Status of the Endorsement. Can be the following enum values: ACCEPTED - Should use this state if the skill already exists. PENDING - Should use this state if the skill does NOT exists.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": [
              "ACCEPTED - Should use this state if the skill already exists.",
              "PENDING - Should use this state if the skill does NOT exists."
            ]
          },
          {
            "Text": "String",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "sample request body",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-body",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Create Endorsements",
        "sample request body"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n    \u0022item\u0022: {\n        \u0022nonStandardEntity\u0022: {\n            \u0022entityPhrase\u0022: \u0022JAVA\u0022,\n            \u0022entityType\u0022: \u0022PROFILE_SKILL\u0022\n        }\n    },\n    \u0022recipient\u0022: \u0022urn:li:person:123ABC\u0022,\n    \u0022status\u0022: \u0022ACCEPTED\u0022\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "sample response header",
      "Anchor": "sample-response-header",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Create Endorsements",
        "sample response header"
      ],
      "Text": "X-RestLi-Id: urn:li:endorsement:(urn:li:person:123ABC,123456)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Endorsements",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-endorsements",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Endorsements"
      ],
      "Text": "Once an endorsement has been created, you can retrieve that endorsement by taking the endorsement URN (urn:li:endorsement:(personUrn,12345)) value returned in the X-RestLi-Id header.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Retrieve Endorsements",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-endorsements",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Endorsements"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/v2/endorsement/urn:li:endorsement:(urn:li:person:123ABC,123456)",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Endorsements",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-endorsements",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Endorsements"
      ],
      "Text": "Above is the API request represented in pretty print. With X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0, you will need to do the following:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
